### Get pipeline statistics across all regions
GET http://localhost:8080/orch/api/pipeline/stats

### Get pipeline stats (localhost)
# GET http://localhost:8081/orch/api/pipeline/stats

### Expected response:
# {
#   "total_regions": 1000,
#   "not_started": 750,
#   "fetch_queued": 50,
#   "fetching": 50,
#   "fetch_failed": 10,
#   "llm_queued": 30,
#   "processing": 20,
#   "done": 90,
#   "invalidated": 0
# }
